@title Wire numbering window: the Number button is disabled when there is nothing to change
@area Schematic
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Number every wire first; the window then has nothing left to do and the button must look disabled.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text "number wires"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
key ctrl+k
text "wire numbering"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
expect "Number"
shot numbering-nothing-to-change
check_layout
